WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:01.935
All right.

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.570
We have breaking news right now.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.438
Rupert Murdoch has now announced

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:06.973
he is stepping down

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.142
as the chairman of Fox Corporation

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.810
and Fox News.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:11.478
Let me bring in

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:13.780
CNN senior media reporter Oliver Darcy

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.482
for more on this.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:18.985
It's been a long awaited question of what

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.353
his plans were for the future,

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.855
what his succession plan was.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.089
This is a big news today.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:23.790
This is huge news.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.491
Rupert Murdoch

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:24.924
saying

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.559
telling employees that he's stepping down

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.294
as chairman of Fox Corp.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.462
and also News Corp

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.297
which is his publishing arm.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:32.332
He wrote to employees

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:33.366
saying he's in good health,

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.635
but now is the time to step down.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:36.302
I want to read to you

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:36.870
part of the note

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:37.937
that just went out to employees

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:38.905
moments ago.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.041
It says here on my phone,

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.075
the time is right for me

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.276
to take on different roles,

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.245
knowing that we have truly talented teams

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:46.579
and a passionate principle leader.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.947
And Lachlan, his son,

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:48.548
who will become

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.383
the chairman of both companies.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.418
And of course, Rupert Murdoch

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:53.286
is one of the most powerful media moguls

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.421
in the world.

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.722
Fox News,

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.491
everyone familiar with it is the arguably

00:00:58.491 --> 00:00:59.893
the strongest

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.128
organ in the right wing media ecosystem.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.096
It propped up Donald Trump

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:03.696
for many years.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.999
I think most people would suggest

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.300
that Donald Trump

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.668
was strongly protected,

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.070
obviously, by Fox News. And this is

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:12.639
Rupert Murdoch,

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:14.107
you know, biggest media company.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.642
And so he he controls all this.

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.009
So him

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:16.609
stepping down

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:17.577
will obviously have

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.779
not only impact in the media world,

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.147
but also in the political world.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.249
I'm just looking at this at this at this

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.452
memo, a letter that you for it

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:26.753
kindly forwarded to me.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.921
And just looking at even

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.622
just the second graph of this, neither

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:30.590
excessive pride

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.058
nor false humility

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:33.827
or admirable qualities,

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:35.428
but I'm truly proud of what we have

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.930
achieved collectively

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.730
through the decades.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.032
And I owe much of my colleagues

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.700
whose contributions to our success

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.402
have sometimes been unseen

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:43.203
outside the company

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.771
but are deeply appreciated by me.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.539
I mean, this is this is real.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:48.241
I mean, this is like the swansong.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.310
This is his farewell to the company.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.113
And interestingly, talk to me about land.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.280
And what this now means is

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.316
he now takes on officially

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.318
a very huge role.

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:00.120
Yeah. This is real life succession.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.521
So Lachlan Murdoch

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:03.723
has been the chief executive

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.525
of Fox of these companies.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:08.628
But now he's going to take on this role

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.463
as as chairman

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.332
and really lead it officially.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:12.932
He's now he's

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.100
now leading the companies

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.136
without his father at his side.

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.237
I think most people,

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:17.637
you know,

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.706
Lachlan has been chief executive,

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:20.907
but most people would still say

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:23.009
that Rupert was really the one

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.011
making the major calls behind the scenes

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.613
when it comes to things.

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:29.315
But now Lachlan is in the driver's seat

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.684
and he has come out on top.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:31.851
You know,

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:32.785
there was a lot of questions

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:33.319
over the years

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:35.388
who would take over these companies

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:36.689
initially. Absolutely.

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:39.225
I mean, Murdoch yes, son would take over.

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:40.260
Then Lachlan came in

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.794
and became chief executive

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:43.396
and now Lachlan is

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:44.964
the one who is the heir apparent

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:48.201
or apparent the heir, the

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:49.903
the now the man in that

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:51.137
will be in charge.

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:53.039
What does this say

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.240
and what do you think

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.309
this will portend for this

00:02:56.543 --> 00:02:59.712
massive media company for the direction

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.381
that is Fox News for?

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:04.951
I mean, he is not just any media mogul.

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:09.722
He had a strong hand in the direction

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:10.356
things took

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:11.024
and the people

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:12.125
that were put in charge,

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.594
like the era of Roger Ailes. Right.

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:17.063
I think if someone like James Murdoch,

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:19.132
the son who is

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:21.734
tends to be more liberal on things

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.836
to come into power,

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:25.305
I think that would mean

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:26.306
major changes

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:28.508
are coming to the companies.

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:29.842
But with Lachlan Murdoch,

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:30.877
I think he's much more aligned

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:32.145
probably with his father's vision.

00:03:32.145 --> 00:03:33.413
He said to be very conservative

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:34.647
on a lot of things.

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:37.550
And so I'm not sure how much of a change

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.485
editorial you'll see, but

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:39.919
certainly there's

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.521
going to be some change.

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.323
You know, Lachlan is not his father.

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:45.425
And so what that looks like,

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:46.025
I don't know

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:47.093
I can tell you right now,

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:49.329
but I would imagine that someone

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:51.231
new coming in, taking the throne,

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:52.966
that is going to lead to some change.

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:53.733
It's so interesting

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.168
because even in this even in this

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.136
letter he takes a shot at

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.540
the elites, which is

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:00.907
always a

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.942
fascinating kind of juxtaposition because

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.178
he's the definition of a media elite.

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:06.980
You could very clearly say.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.348
But he also ends this

00:04:08.348 --> 00:04:10.383
with talking about in my new role.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:12.652
Is there any word of what new role

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:13.253
he's talking about?

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.954
Like this is not him going into

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:16.322
but is this effectively

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:17.590
he is going into retirement

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.592
or he's taking on a different project

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:20.193
from here on out?

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.961
I don't think anyone's ever going to say

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:22.695
that Rupert Murdoch

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:24.063
is going into retirement.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:25.064
I don't think that's something

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:26.966
that is capable of those words

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:28.034
he's not capable of uttering.

00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:29.269
But I do think this is as close

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:29.469
as we're

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:31.170
probably going to get to him

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.606
announcing that he is stepping down.

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:35.341
I mean, he is announcing stepping down

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:37.644
from from these roles. I mean, he's 92.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.879
So while people say he is in

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:41.147
great health, he has

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:42.081
some had had some health

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:42.782
scares over the years.

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:43.783
And I imagine that

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.018
even if you are an incredibly

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:46.085
healthy natural

00:04:46.085 --> 00:04:47.720
you know, running these companies is a

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.289
is a huge task.

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:50.790
And so you need someone

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.659
who's able to devote

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:54.227
the full attention

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:54.727
that it takes

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.129
to run these massive media companies.

00:04:56.129 --> 00:04:58.298
And he's he's saying that he's

00:04:58.298 --> 00:04:59.432
going to hand it off to Lachlan.

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:00.466
Well and you've done so much

00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:03.269
reporting over the years of just kind of

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:05.805
I keep wanting to call it the

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:07.106
success of this succession,

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:08.341
but it really is

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:10.543
that it's not just that amazing series

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:14.781
of kind of how he had for years,

00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:17.984
tried to groom his sons

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:19.485
and like put them in positions.

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:19.986
I remember

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:20.820
just stories about

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:21.621
it was either Lachlan

00:05:21.621 --> 00:05:22.789
or James that he would put in

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.090
is like an internship

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.425
they put him in internships

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:27.160
in the various companies

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.461
and the headlines

00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:29.395
that would come out from it

00:05:29.395 --> 00:05:30.463
when one of them falls

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:31.664
was seen as falling asleep

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:33.266
on the job or something.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.335
And just kind of what this is,

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:38.104
it is a family family affair

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:39.972
for for the Murdochs

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:42.208
and what it is also done to this family.

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:42.542
Yeah.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:45.078
And the empire used to be a lot

00:05:45.078 --> 00:05:45.945
bigger, right?

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:46.913
I mean, Rupert sold

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:49.048
a lot of the empire to Disney,

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:50.183
you know, the movie studio.

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:52.819
And so now the empire that Lachlan

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:53.753
will be taking

00:05:53.753 --> 00:05:55.321
hold of, it's still very powerful.

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:57.023
It still has Fox News,

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:57.990
you know, The Wall Street Journal,

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.792
some very powerful entities in it.

00:05:59.792 --> 00:06:01.461
But it's not the big

00:06:01.461 --> 00:06:03.596
entertainment company that this once was.

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:06.499
It is now mostly a news company.

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:07.500
And in a sports company,

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.568
they do Fox Sports, obviously,

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:11.003
but it's not the big media giant. It was.

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:11.771
And so

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:13.539
