00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:16.342
I think that it's not necessarily

00:06:16.976 --> 00:06:17.910
the throne.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.079
The empire isn't as big as it once was.

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:20.480
Right.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:21.481
There's so much.

00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:21.614
Is it

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:22.582
going to be a lot of reaction

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:24.851
